---
alt: "Next.js Request Flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Next.js Request Flow
    accDescr: Sequence of events for handling a request in Next.js.

    participant Client as Browser
    participant Server as Next.js Server
    participant Router as Router (App/Pages)
    participant Renderer as Renderer
    participant Data as Data Layer

    Client->>Server: HTTP Request
    Server->>Router: Match Route
    
    alt Static Content
        Router-->>Server: Serve Static File
        Server-->>Client: Static Response
    else Dynamic Content
        Router->>Renderer: Render Page/Component
        Renderer->>Data: Fetch Data (getStaticProps/getServerSideProps/RSC)
        Data-->>Renderer: Data
        Renderer-->>Server: HTML/RSC Payload
        Server-->>Client: HTTP Response
    end
    
    Client->>Client: Hydration (if applicable)
